      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "text": "Input: [H_frame + Linear(s)]\n\u2022 Multi-layer Bi-GRU + Convolutions\n\u2022 Pitch Predictor: log(F0) contour\n\u2022 Energy Predictor: RMS norm\n\u2022 Pitch Shift Dial (semitone scale)\nOutputs:\n  F0: (B, T_frames), E: (B, T_frames)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Input: [H_frame + Linear(s)]\n\u2022 Multi-layer Bi-GRU + Convolutions\n\u2022 Pitch Predictor: log(F0) contour\n\u2022 Energy Predictor: RMS norm\n\u2022 Pitch Shift Dial (semitone scale)\nOutputs:\n  F0: (B, T_frames), E: (B, T_frames)"
    },
