      "updated": 1,
      "text": "5. AdaIN Residual Generator",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. AdaIN Residual Generator"
    },
    {
      "id": "box_decoder_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 752,
      "y": 218,
      "width": 306,
      "height": 245,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 921048,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "text": "Core Non-Autoregressive Synthesis Engine\nFused Inputs:\n  \u2022 H_frame (Acoustic content)\n  \u2022 F0 contour embedding & Energy\n  \u2022 Style vector s via AdaIN:\n    AdaIN(x, s) = \u03c3(s) * (x - \u03bc) / \u03c3 + \u03bc(s)\nArchitecture:\n  \u2022 4x Cascaded Up-sampling Conv1D\n  \u2022 Multi-Receptive Field (MRF) ResBlocks\n  \u2022 Dilated Conv filters (kernel 3, 7, 11)\nLatency: ~220 ms (Single Forward Pass!)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Non-Autoregressive Synthesis Engine\nFused Inputs:\n  \u2022 H_frame (Acoustic content)\n  \u2022 F0 contour embedding & Energy\n  \u2022 Style vector s via AdaIN:\n    AdaIN(x, s) = \u03c3(s) * (x - \u03bc) / \u03c3 + \u03bc(s)\nArchitecture:\n  \u2022 4x Cascaded Up-sampling Conv1D\n  \u2022 Multi-Receptive Field (MRF) ResBlocks\n  \u2022 Dilated Conv filters (kernel 3, 7, 11)\nLatency: ~220 ms (Single Forward Pass!)"
    },
