      "text": "Vocos / HiFi-GAN Vocoder\n\u2022 ISTFT / Polyphase synthesis\n\u2022 Peak Attenuation (-1 dB limiter)\nOutputs:\n  \u2022 Native: 24 kHz Hi-Fi PCM\n  \u2022 Resampled: 16 kHz PCM\nShape: (B, 1, T_audio) in [-1, 1]",
