      "updated": 1,
      "text": "\u2696\ufe0f Training Objective & Adversarial Feedback (Discriminators)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2696\ufe0f Training Objective & Adversarial Feedback (Discriminators)"
    },
    {
      "id": "box_loss_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 92,
      "y": 648,
      "width": 1296,
      "height": 115,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 302675,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 Multi-Period Discriminator (MPD): Analyzes periodic harmonic patterns at periods [2, 3, 5, 7, 11]\n\u2022 Multi-Scale Spectrogram Discriminator (MSD): Evaluates consecutive structural audio frames across multiple temporal resolutions\n\u2022 Joint Loss Function:  L_total = L_adv(G; D) + \u03bb_fm * L_fm(G; D) + \u03bb_mel * L_mel(y, \u0177) + \u03bb_F0 * L_F0 + \u03bb_dur * L_dur\n  \u2794 Enables single-pass naturalness WITHOUT slow diffusion sampling at runtime!",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Multi-Period Discriminator (MPD): Analyzes periodic harmonic patterns at periods [2, 3, 5, 7, 11]\n\u2022 Multi-Scale Spectrogram Discriminator (MSD): Evaluates consecutive structural audio frames across multiple temporal resolutions\n\u2022 Joint Loss Function:  L_total = L_adv(G; D) + \u03bb_fm * L_fm(G; D) + \u03bb_mel * L_mel(y, \u0177) + \u03bb_F0 * L_F0 + \u03bb_dur * L_dur\n  \u2794 Enables single-pass naturalness WITHOUT slow diffusion sampling at runtime!"
    },
